    "description": "Worked on over 40+ different websites/projects. Developed Full-Stack Web Applications and Mobile Apps using: PHP, C#, TypeScript / JavaScript, WordPress, React, Node.js, Apache Kafka / Redpanda.\nHosted services via: Google Cloud, Pantheon.IO, Pusher, DigitalOcean.\nTeam Coordination via: Jira, Confluence, Slack\n\n* Individual contributor and technical resource for a team of web developers. Provided mentorship, guidance, and \nassisted with advanced technical questions.\n* Acted as a subject matter expert (SME) for multiple client projects. \n* Spearheaded the integration of Test-Driven Development (TDD) and OOP design patterns to ensure best practices.\n* Responsible for 48+ client websites and domains, including multiple non-profits, a large insurance & dental client, and multiple front-ends for financial institutions / banks. In charge of quarterly updates, backups, and status monitoring\n* Migrated over 20 websites from shared hosting to DigitalOcean VPS, and later to Pantheon Cloud. \n* Helped Project Managers understand scopes of technical/web work, improving estimates and client communication.\n* Worked closely with clients to develop solutions that met their needs. Advocated for a non-profit client that needed modifications to their designs on web, to adapt the UX from the printed copy.",
